  "licensed_claim": "At exact candidate revision 8eae9b3e3e12634571134e26ab7422bcab7457af, one opt-in Enforced Planning source consumer derived admission from exact live claim, tracker, selection, Project Graph-bound portfolio allocation, scenario, and effective continuation evidence. Public bootstrap rejected source-write smuggling; missing selection denied heartbeat without mutation; the active allocation allowed selected inspection, ordinary-authorized hard pre-write, and heartbeat; parking the allocation then made the same heartbeat and ordinary-authorized hard pre-write fail closed without heartbeat mutation. An equivalent circular live-state test denies outcome_stalled and preserves target bytes. This licenses a separately reviewed source activation pilot, not activation or fleet adoption.",
